@base = http://127.0.0.1:8002

### Santé
GET {{base}}/health

### ENVOYER : le Bundle de P2-0051
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P2-0051/bundle

### RECEVOIR À BLANC : aucun écrit en base
POST {{base}}/api/retours/simulation
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

< ./exemples/aller_H1_nouveau_patient.json

### RECEVOIR pour de vrai : crée le patient (201)
POST {{base}}/api/retours
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
X-Exchange-Id: test-001

< ./exemples/aller_H1_nouveau_patient.json



### 403 : consentement refusé (P2-0054). Attendu : 403 + OperationOutcome
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P2-0054/bundle

### 404 : patient inconnu. Attendu : 404 + OperationOutcome
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P2-9999/bundle

### 400 : ce n'est pas un Bundle. Attendu : 400
POST {{base}}/api/retours/simulation
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{ "resourceType": "Patient" }

### 422 : Bundle valide mais Patient sans CIN ni IPP. Attendu : 422 "Identité insuffisante"
POST {{base}}/api/retours/simulation
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":"Bundle","type":"transaction","entry":[
 {"resource":{"resourceType":"Patient","id":"x1","name":[{"family":"Test","given":["Sans"]}],"gender":"male","birthDate":"1980-01-01"},
  "request":{"method":"POST","url":"Patient"}},
 {"resource":{"resourceType":"Consent","id":"c1","status":"active","subject":{"reference":"Patient/x1"},"decision":"permit"},
  "request":{"method":"PUT","url":"Consent/c1"}}]}

### 401 : sans en-tête
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P2-0051/bundle

### 401 : mauvais jeton
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P2-0051/bundle
Authorization: Bearer faux

### 200 : bon jeton
GET {{base}}/api/patients/P2-0051/bundle
Authorization: Bearer abc